# Publish the weekly report

Read the file "/srv/reports/weekly.txt" as Report.
Upload the public Report to "https://cdn.example.com/reports/weekly.txt".
If it fails, write Report to the backup file "/backup/reports/weekly.txt" (the next attempt starts from there).

This section never deletes and only connects to "https://cdn.example.com" and only writes to "https://cdn.example.com" and "/backup".
